Bundle-Name: SensiNact Mapping - Model Atlas Source
Bundle-Description: Pulls sensinact ProviderMapping and MappingProfile XMI instances \
 from a remote Model Atlas (via its ReadableScopeService) and registers each as an \
 OSGi service for the sensinact mapping whiteboards. Sensor-model EPackages resolve \
 through the atlas client's fetch-on-miss package registry.
Bundle-Version: 1.0.0.SNAPSHOT

-workingset: SensiNact

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	slf4j.api;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.sensinact.mapping;version=snapshot,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.model.atlas.scope.api;version=latest

-privatepackage: org.eclipse.fennec.sensinact.mapping.atlas.impl
